---
/**
 * Coaching page: “Experiential Learning Games” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-a0f25e9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="a0f25e9"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-c1742de e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="c1742de"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-543727d vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
        data-id="543727d"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="heading.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">Experiential <br />Learning Games</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-f213ebc vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
        data-id="f213ebc"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <p>
            Our experiential learning sessions use an immersive, high-energy simulation that brings out the natural
            leadership styles, decision-making patterns, and team dynamics. Each session is followed by a facilitated
            debrief that connects these real-time behaviours to workplace realities – turning insights into actionable
            growth.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-7c56aac e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child"
      data-id="7c56aac"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-39a0234 vb-position-top vb-widget vb-widget-image-box"
        data-id="39a0234"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="image-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-image-box-wrapper">
            <figure class="vb-image-box-img">
              <a href="/crisis/" tabindex="-1"
                ><img
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                  width="350"
                  height="150"
                  src="/assets/uploads/2024/07/crisis.png"
                  class="attachment-full size-full site-image-17754"
                  alt=""
                /></a>
            </figure><div class="vb-image-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-image-box-title"><a href="/crisis/">CRISIS</a></h3>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-454f247 vb-position-top vb-widget vb-widget-image-box"
        data-id="454f247"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="image-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-image-box-wrapper">
            <figure class="vb-image-box-img">
              <a href="/angels-18/" tabindex="-1"
                ><img
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                  width="350"
                  height="150"
                  src="/assets/uploads/2024/07/angles18.png"
                  class="attachment-full size-full site-image-17759"
                  alt="Aerial View of Mountainous Terrain with Map Overlay |venturebean"
                /></a>
            </figure><div class="vb-image-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-image-box-title"><a href="/angels-18/">Angels18</a></h3>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-f1c90f3 vb-position-top vb-widget vb-widget-image-box"
        data-id="f1c90f3"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="image-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-image-box-wrapper">
            <figure class="vb-image-box-img">
              <a href="/36-hours/" tabindex="-1"
                ><img
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                  width="350"
                  height="150"
                  src="/assets/uploads/2024/07/36-hours.png"
                  class="attachment-full size-full site-image-17758"
                  alt="Creative Time Management Concept Art,36 hours |venturebean"
                /></a>
            </figure><div class="vb-image-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-image-box-title"><a href="/36-hours/">36 Hours</a></h3>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
